# Docms monorepo .gitignore (API + Admin + Frontend)

# OS & Editor artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Node modules
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Build outputs
build/
**/build/
dist/
**/dist/
dist-ssr/

# TypeScript incremental build info
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Test coverage
coverage/
**/coverage/
**/lcov-report/
coverage-final.json
lcov.info
clover.xml

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Admin (Vite/Vue 3)
admin/dist/
admin/.vite/
admin/.cache/

# API (NestJS)
api/dist/
api/tsconfig.build.tsbuildinfo

# Prisma & local SQLite database
api/prisma/dev.db

# Uploads & generated media
uploads/
**/uploads/

# Test artifacts
api-test-output*.log
api-test-results.json

# Claude Code local settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Development documentation and test reports
# (These are session-specific and shouldn't be in version control)
**/SESSION_TEST_SUMMARY*.md
**/DEVELOPMENT_PROGRESS*.md
**/FUNCTIONAL_TEST_REPORT*.md
**/TEST_SUMMARY*.md
**/*_TEST_SUCCESS.png
**/*_FIXED*.png
**/*_FIX_SUMMARY.md
**/*_INVESTIGATION.md
**/*_DEVELOPMENT_SUMMARY.md
**/*_TEST_REPORT*.md

# Temporary/debug files
nul
**/nul

# Chinese filename artifacts
**/提示词.md
提示词.md

# All development summaries, plans, and reports
**/*_SUMMARY.md
**/ADMIN_FINAL_SUMMARY*.md
**/FINAL_*.md
**/*_PLAN.md
**/*_FIX.md
**/*_ENHANCEMENT.md
**/ARTICLE_*.md
admin/*.png
admin/**/*.png